                    *************** 4.0 ***************
                 "Dragon's Lord", The Game Behind The Game

        I, Paul Taulborg, AKA DragonLord, wrote this game sytem a few years
back in which I ran live with many a group of friends. It was a hit. Many
people loved the game, and the flexibility of it. The variety of classes
and races made it very versatile. And because it had so much to it, I never
dreamt it could be made into a program and still do the system proper
justice. I was very wrong.
        I started work on this program in April, 1997. The going was very
slow at first, because I tried to do too much too soon. I then started
doing little bits at a time, until working versions started coming out. And
not just any versions, but apparently very stable versions.
        Someday I hope to complete this program, and have it be as close to
a replica of my real-life system as possible.

This is by no means the final version of this game. In fact, it is merely
the beginning. I have put endless hours of work into this. And what you
have before you is the result. I hope you enjoy it.


